==Notes==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*The bonus damage (reported as [[divine damage]]) is from a [[damage increase]] effect, so it ignores both [[damage resistance]] and damage [[immunity]].
*The attack, damage, and saving throw bonuses increase by a further +2 every five levels and the damage reduction increases as well.

