* Since ''[[sacred defense]]'' also counts to the +20 cap on saving throws, there is effectively no increase in saving throw bonuses from this feat after level 20. (The cap is reached at level 22, when the +11 bonus from ''sacred defense'', plus the +9 from this feat, hits the cap.)

